WEBVTT

00:08:57.575 --> 00:09:01.996
If anyone says
they know what pure good is,

00:09:02.037 --> 00:09:03.289
it's probably evil.

00:09:03.706 --> 00:09:06.834
(Laughter)

00:09:10.462 --> 00:09:16.594
In fantasy tales of hobbits
and elves and dwarves,

00:09:16.594 --> 00:09:21.640
there was an idea that good comes
in different forms and shapes,

00:09:21.682 --> 00:09:22.975
often in conflict.

00:09:23.017 --> 00:09:26.270
But they had to be united
when facing absolute evil.

00:09:26.770 --> 00:09:28.397
Good will disagree.

00:09:28.439 --> 00:09:31.734
Evil says, "No more disagreements ever."